---
title: "The /run pipeline: what the user sees"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: idle
    lg1: done
    lg2: failed
    lg3: risk
    lg4: active
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 pink
  class lg4 purple
  s0: No run
  s1: Agent working
  s2: Checking gates
  s3: Checking the plan was carried out
  s4: Restarting the agent
  s5: Run failed
  s6: Agent working, after a retry
  s7: Merging
  s8: Run finished, merged
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you run a spec
  s1 --> s2: the agent finishes
  s1 --> s3: the agent finishes [no gates defined]
  s3 --> s4: they disagree, and the run retries
  s2 --> s4: a gate fails, and the run retries
  s2 --> s5: a gate hangs or a gate fails, and the budget is spent
  s2 --> s3: the gates pass
  s4 --> s6: the new agent starts
  s6 --> s2: the agent finishes
  s6 --> s3: the agent finishes [no gates defined]
  s3 --> s7: the checklist and the verdict agree
  s7 --> s8: the merge lands
  s7 --> s5: the merge fails
  s4 --> s5: no agent could be started
  s3 --> s5: they disagree, and the budget is spent
  class s0 tan
  class s1 purple
  class s2 purple
  class s3 purple
  class s4 pink
  class s5 orange
  class s6 purple
  class s7 pink
  class s8 blue
